WEBVTT

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:22.088
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:26.593
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:30.663
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:35.268
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:43.309
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:54.083
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:58.525
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:02.962
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:07.033
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:14.701
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:35.016
Hey...

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:37.055
What?

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.899
I'm so glad. I thought you'd
fallen asleep and left me.

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:44.400
Outside...

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:46.471
...is it night?

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:49.873
It is, Joganki.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.711
Are you all right?

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:53.110
Are you in any pain?

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:57.676
If I said that I was in pain, would you
release me from these restraints?

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:01.314
I can't do that, because you're incredible.

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:04.423
I am powerless here. You know that.

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:07.994
I suppose, but even so, I can't.

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:09.359
I still...

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:11.357
...want to stay this way.

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:16.934
Engage

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:24.438
I would like to formally thank you.

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:28.982
I am truly grateful that you
have accepted my request.

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:31.551
Let's not have any of that stiff and formal stuff.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:33.486
This is just a job to me.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.954
I'll get paid to carry out the job. That's all.

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:39.417
All right. Then let us begin the briefing.

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:42.952
This is the target location.

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:45.889
It is approximately 3 hours away by air.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.525
Rona Fauna is entrenched in this facility.

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:50.530
What's the layout?

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:53.871
Four floors above ground, twenty underground.

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:58.311
I have sent this blueprint to your tank's database.

00:02:58.311 --> 00:03:00.914
However, we surmise that
there is a high probability...

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.142
...that the layout has changed.

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:03.875
What do you mean?

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:05.784
This is how it looks now.

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:09.489
The facility is covered with minute structures...

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:10.786
...believed to be nanomachines.

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.791
We assume the interior has
likewise been altered.

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:17.030
Rona Fauna did this?

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.531
We can think of no other possibility.

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:20.133
What for?

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:21.532
What's her reason for doing this?

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:23.528
I'm afraid I don't know...

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:43.323
Your opponent's firepower includes
a 2-unit team consisting of...

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:46.526
...a mobile aerial fighting unit and
an armored land fighting unit.

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:47.961
They are extremely lightweight...

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:50.293
...and this configuration is
made for high mobility.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.572
In terms of simple numbers,

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:02.442
there are 30 autonomous soldiers,
10 attack helos,

00:04:02.442 --> 00:04:04.307
and 2 heavily equipped mop-up units.

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:19.387
Her reaction time is far superior
to that of autonomous soldiers.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.720
A human with an astral eye
that is unlike our own.

00:04:24.697 --> 00:04:27.791
The abilities of which are still inscrutable.

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:31.963
Good work.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.664
You looked good out there.

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:38.538
With the increase in power, it's quite a bit lighter.

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:41.547
And the accuracy of the
Dragon Buster's improved, too.

00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:45.381
But no matter how you look at it,
our opponent outguns us.

00:04:45.685 --> 00:04:48.121
If you just compare the numbers,
that would be true.

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:51.818
But there's no need to actually
take them all on, right?

00:04:52.258 --> 00:04:54.419
If we just scoot right into the facility?

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:57.160
Exactly. It'll be a question of speed.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.157
And wing it after that?

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:00.967
We'll have to take things as they come.

00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:02.025
But I like that sort of thing.

00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:05.238
Isn't that kind of a stupid way to go about it?

00:05:05.238 --> 00:05:07.740
You think so? That's life, though.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:11.544
Huh... Well, if you say so, Teacher.

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:14.147
Now, go back and take a shower.

00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:15.045
Roger.

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:24.757
Bogie, what're those?

00:05:24.757 --> 00:05:25.951
They're drag chutes.

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:28.661
Huh. What're they used for?

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:32.688
If the transport plane gets shot down,
we'll use them to land.

00:05:32.932 --> 00:05:34.194
Huh...

00:05:38.938 --> 00:05:41.074
This sure does feel like war.

00:05:41.074 --> 00:05:42.939
Can you pull off a stunt like that?

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:44.977
I'm running simulations.

00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:47.814
But I'm praying that we won't have to use them.

00:05:47.814 --> 00:05:52.046
Yeah, I can't imagine jumping
down from the sky in a tank.

00:05:52.852 --> 00:05:57.523
Now then, guess I'll get
some rest before we leave.

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:59.992
Good idea. The mission's taking place
in the middle of the night.

00:05:59.992 --> 00:06:02.628
We can't have you getting
sleepy halfway through.

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:04.197
What kind of child do you think I am?

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:05.289
A child who sleeps well.

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:06.933
Hmph.

00:06:06.933 --> 00:06:10.528
Lack of sleep is the biggest threat to your skin!

00:07:00.553 --> 00:07:02.145
What was that?

00:07:08.594 --> 00:07:09.993
Rona Fauna...

00:07:12.265 --> 00:07:14.233
The moon is very pretty.

00:07:16.569 --> 00:07:18.935
I wish you could see it, too.

00:07:20.673 --> 00:07:22.975
How many days has it been now?

00:07:22.975 --> 00:07:24.840
Eleven days.

00:07:24.911 --> 00:07:26.902
How long are you planning to keep this up?

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.970
Are you bored?

00:07:29.315 --> 00:07:31.681
That's not an answer.

00:07:48.034 --> 00:07:54.030
Loading of DT302CMH-J-521219 is complete.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:08.912
That is...

00:08:09.422 --> 00:08:10.980
That is...

00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:21.390
Yes?

00:08:23.269 --> 00:08:24.395
I-Iks?!

00:08:26.105 --> 00:08:27.240
Pardon the intrusion.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:29.308
What do you mean "pardon the intrusion?"

00:08:29.308 --> 00:08:31.210
What... What are you doing here?

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:35.237
I've already introduced myself to
Fila Marique, so there's no problem.

00:08:35.548 --> 00:08:38.415
Uh, no, so like, that's not the issue here...

00:08:38.851 --> 00:08:41.787
I will accompany you, no matter where you go.

00:08:41.787 --> 00:08:43.414
That was our agreement, was it not?

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:45.191
Well, yeah...

00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:47.927
At any rate, is that a new suit?

00:08:47.927 --> 00:08:48.928
Huh?!

00:08:48.928 --> 00:08:52.921
Y-Yeah, it's light and sturdy
and easy to move in...

00:08:53.833 --> 00:08:56.666
Miss Honoka, this seems to be
quite a troublesome situation.

00:08:57.103 --> 00:08:59.833
What? Y-Yeah...

00:09:02.742 --> 00:09:05.040
It's kind of all wrong, you know?

00:09:05.745 --> 00:09:10.283
Sure, I'm a jack-of-all-trades,
but this is a mercenary's job.

00:09:10.283 --> 00:09:12.952
I don't have the knowledge of a mercenary.

00:09:12.952 --> 00:09:15.388
If I went head-to-head on a level playing field,

00:09:15.388 --> 00:09:17.185
I'd never be a match for Kevin and the others.

00:09:17.557 --> 00:09:19.559
I've got no business doing this.

00:09:19.559 --> 00:09:22.619
But even knowing that,
you are still going, correct?

00:09:23.062 --> 00:09:24.029
Yeah.

00:09:24.363 --> 00:09:25.921
For Joganki...

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:31.671
Aw, man, it's stupid, isn't it?
He's always bothering me.

00:09:31.671 --> 00:09:35.232
So what if he's in danger?
It's not my problem.

00:09:35.675 --> 00:09:39.712
When you see him next,
you will have to tell him that clearly.

00:09:39.712 --> 00:09:42.044
Yeah, talk about a pain in the butt!

00:09:45.351 --> 00:09:46.285
You know...

00:09:46.285 --> 00:09:46.751
Yes?

00:09:47.186 --> 00:09:51.213
W-Well, I'm happy you came.

00:09:52.091 --> 00:09:53.581
Are you ready?

00:09:54.493 --> 00:09:55.755
Oh, hello.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:09:59.397
Why are you here?

00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:01.434
Please do not worry, Teacher.

00:10:01.434 --> 00:10:04.130
I made sure to receive
permission from Fila Marique.

00:10:04.236 --> 00:10:05.498
Huh...

00:10:05.705 --> 00:10:07.229
W-What's up?

00:10:12.345 --> 00:10:15.439
Is that a new suit? It's thinner
than the old one, isn't it?

00:10:15.514 --> 00:10:16.649
It looks good on you.

00:10:16.649 --> 00:10:17.980
T-Thanks.

00:10:18.117 --> 00:10:18.640
So?

00:10:19.151 --> 00:10:19.810
Yes?

00:10:20.052 --> 00:10:21.621
You're going, too?

00:10:21.621 --> 00:10:22.451
Yes.

00:10:22.555 --> 00:10:24.957
You seem as laid back as ever.

00:10:24.957 --> 00:10:25.753
Pardon me.

00:10:25.958 --> 00:10:29.428
Aw, man! This was supposed to be
a vacation for just the two of us.

00:10:29.428 --> 00:10:31.123
Vacation...

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:36.868
Honoka, it's almost time.

00:10:37.069 --> 00:10:38.671
Got it. I'll be right over.

00:10:38.671 --> 00:10:39.472
How're you doing?

00:10:39.472 --> 00:10:40.673
I'm on-board already.

00:10:40.673 --> 00:10:43.075
My, how quick you are to get ready.

00:10:43.075 --> 00:10:44.872
Don't forget to go to the bathroom.

00:10:44.977 --> 00:10:47.747
Like I said! What am I, some common brat?!

00:10:47.747 --> 00:10:49.237
There ain't no way I'm wetting my pants-

00:10:57.657 --> 00:10:59.859
Wow! This is it?

00:10:59.859 --> 00:11:03.056
Yes. It will be piloted by an artificial intelligence.

00:11:03.462 --> 00:11:05.831
There will be no danger of being
commandeered by Rona Fauna.

00:11:05.831 --> 00:11:10.770
Yeah, that's right! I get to ride in an airplane!

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.371
What are you so excited about?

00:11:12.371 --> 00:11:13.906
What are you so calm about?!

00:11:13.906 --> 00:11:15.808
An airplane! We're riding an airplane!

00:11:15.808 --> 00:11:17.476
We're going to fly the skies! The skies!

00:11:17.476 --> 00:11:18.210
So?

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:19.142
Doesn't it get you fired up?!

00:11:19.745 --> 00:11:22.373
All such feelings evaporated when
the third wheel showed up.

00:11:23.482 --> 00:11:24.676
I see...

00:11:24.984 --> 00:11:26.246
May we proceed?

00:11:26.318 --> 00:11:27.615
Oh, yes, yes.

00:11:28.387 --> 00:11:31.490
The mission schedule is exactly
as we determined earlier.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:32.479
There are no changes.

00:11:32.758 --> 00:11:36.429
Hop on over there and zip right back!
Roger, roger.

00:11:36.429 --> 00:11:37.726
So, can I get on the plane now?

00:11:38.531 --> 00:11:39.725
There is one more thing.

00:11:39.999 --> 00:11:42.729
What is it? Hurry up!

00:11:49.575 --> 00:11:50.507
Huh?

00:11:59.652 --> 00:12:03.452
Will you allow him to accompany you?

00:12:09.195 --> 00:12:10.662
Blue Breaker...

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:12.795
Zankan's killer.

00:12:13.766 --> 00:12:17.236
At this unexpected reunion with the blue unit,

00:12:17.236 --> 00:12:19.966
with the momentous task still before her,

00:12:20.339 --> 00:12:22.569
Honoka's heart was thrown into turmoil.

00:12:50.836 --> 00:12:51.393
Why?

00:12:51.771 --> 00:12:53.568
Because he will add to your firepower.

00:12:53.839 --> 00:12:57.109
His artificial brain was created
through a special process.

00:12:57.109 --> 00:12:59.168
He is a mutation of sorts.

00:12:59.678 --> 00:13:02.806
He will not be controlled by anyone except us.

00:13:03.115 --> 00:13:04.776
This has already been proven.

00:13:05.651 --> 00:13:08.176
So, it was him, just like I thought.

00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:14.487
He will be a calculable and valuable asset.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:17.029
This isn't a pretty tactic.

00:13:17.029 --> 00:13:21.363
You knew Hono would refuse,
so you're forcing it on her like this.

00:13:22.067 --> 00:13:24.228
I believe it was a logical decision.

00:13:24.537 --> 00:13:25.868
How commendable.

00:13:26.038 --> 00:13:29.235
What are the merits? What are the
merits of taking him with us?

00:13:29.842 --> 00:13:32.242
It all comes down to his
superior combat abilities.

00:13:32.778 --> 00:13:35.047
What do you think, Teacher?

00:13:35.047 --> 00:13:37.416
I can understand her thought process.

00:13:37.416 --> 00:13:39.247
Ultimately, our enemy consists of normal units.

00:13:39.985 --> 00:13:44.979
He's probably worth several dozen of
your ordinary autonomous soldiers.

00:13:45.291 --> 00:13:49.195
However, if the team isn't united in its purpose,

00:13:49.195 --> 00:13:50.992
superior combat abilities will be meaningless.

00:13:51.864 --> 00:13:54.458
In which case, it'd be better
to send him by himself.

00:13:54.867 --> 00:13:58.303
That's my opinion. The rest is up to you, Hono.

00:13:58.437 --> 00:14:01.201
You're the leader. You're the one
who has to make the decision.

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.083
We do not have much time.

00:14:16.622 --> 00:14:18.613
If you are absolutely adamant...

00:14:19.625 --> 00:14:20.717
I'll take him.

00:14:22.394 --> 00:14:24.589
But I have some conditions.

00:14:27.066 --> 00:14:29.869
You will follow my orders during this job.

00:14:29.869 --> 00:14:33.339
And if you ever take action independently,

00:14:33.339 --> 00:14:35.807
or in the unlikely event that
you are commandeered,

00:14:36.976 --> 00:14:37.806
I'll cut you down.

00:14:39.712 --> 00:14:41.009
Understood.

00:14:42.014 --> 00:14:44.350
Deep beneath Honoka's chilly gaze,

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:47.419
flames of rage burned hot enough
to consume her entirely...

00:14:47.419 --> 00:14:49.785
...and they continued to gnaw away at her heart.

00:14:51.257 --> 00:14:54.226
This mass of hatred had suddenly
appeared before her...

00:14:54.226 --> 00:14:56.319
...and she wanted to crush
it with her bare hands.

00:14:57.429 --> 00:15:01.024
But this was a job and he was necessary.

00:15:02.001 --> 00:15:04.870
As the pain in her heart threatened to overflow,

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:07.304
she determinedly and
dispassionately stamped it down.

00:15:12.511 --> 00:15:15.912
Answer me. How long do you
plan to keep this up?

00:15:17.049 --> 00:15:18.346
I haven't decided.

00:15:18.884 --> 00:15:22.183
You can't keep this up forever.

00:15:22.821 --> 00:15:23.583
Why not?

00:15:24.156 --> 00:15:27.226
The Central Integrated Government
should be putting all their resources...

00:15:27.226 --> 00:15:29.995
...into resolving this situation.

00:15:29.995 --> 00:15:33.666
Ultimately, even if they have to commit
the entire Inspection Force,

00:15:33.666 --> 00:15:35.734
they will surely destroy this place.

00:15:35.734 --> 00:15:37.436
That's impossible.

00:15:37.436 --> 00:15:39.404
After all, you're here.

00:15:39.805 --> 00:15:42.603
If they did that, you would be lost.

00:15:42.841 --> 00:15:46.834
They will not hesitate to sacrifice me.

00:15:47.313 --> 00:15:48.405
You're lying!

00:15:48.614 --> 00:15:51.105
It's unthinkable that they would sacrifice you!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.586
What will serve to benefit this planet?

00:15:54.586 --> 00:16:00.456
That is our first... No, as The Third,
that is all we think about.

00:16:00.926 --> 00:16:05.363
Allowing you to continue as you are
will only serve to hurt this planet.

00:16:08.467 --> 00:16:09.593
You're lying.

00:16:24.717 --> 00:16:27.117
What's wrong? Are you not feeling well?

00:16:27.753 --> 00:16:28.721
I gotta go!

00:16:28.721 --> 00:16:29.449
No way!

00:16:29.788 --> 00:16:30.379
I do!

00:16:30.723 --> 00:16:33.590
Can't you wait until the green light comes on?

00:16:34.526 --> 00:16:35.390
I don't know.

00:16:35.894 --> 00:16:36.918
What is the matter?

00:16:40.232 --> 00:16:41.961
Pilot, what is this turbulence?

00:16:42.301 --> 00:16:43.666
We have reached cruising speed.

00:16:44.336 --> 00:16:46.739
Docking with STW-9000.

00:16:46.739 --> 00:16:47.639
9000?

00:16:47.639 --> 00:16:48.901
That'd be Blue Breaker.

00:16:49.575 --> 00:16:52.305
Bastard! If you make me wet my
pants now, I'll cut you down!

00:17:09.762 --> 00:17:10.729
Miss Honoka?

00:17:11.163 --> 00:17:15.065
Good grief. Looks like she
really was at her limit.

00:17:36.155 --> 00:17:38.323
As I thought, it is nowhere to be found.

00:17:38.323 --> 00:17:39.790
Rona Fauna...

00:17:41.593 --> 00:17:44.163
It is impossible for an individual's
information to disappear.

00:17:44.163 --> 00:17:46.529
Not unless someone expunges it.

00:17:47.199 --> 00:17:50.999
Only Permanent Councilors are
capable of such a thing.

00:17:51.503 --> 00:17:52.970
Who would do that?

00:17:53.539 --> 00:17:55.131
For what purpose?

00:17:57.676 --> 00:18:02.113
The wormhole driver is the ultimate
destructive space-time weapon.

00:18:02.915 --> 00:18:05.406
It can bypass 3-dimensional space...

00:18:05.484 --> 00:18:09.113
...and launch an attack directly at its target.

00:18:09.621 --> 00:18:10.815
What of it?

00:18:11.423 --> 00:18:15.382
A wormhole, in short, is a kind of black hole.

00:18:15.561 --> 00:18:18.325
If it were to be fired into the core of this planet...

00:18:19.298 --> 00:18:22.665
The planet will suffer a gravitational
collapse from the inside out.

00:18:23.035 --> 00:18:25.230
Does that really bother you that much?

00:18:25.671 --> 00:18:28.572
Is that why the Central Integrated
Government will sacrifice you?

00:18:28.941 --> 00:18:31.210
Whether it bothers me or not...

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.378
Rona Fauna,

00:18:33.378 --> 00:18:36.074
if you are also a member of The Third,
you should know the answer.

00:18:36.448 --> 00:18:40.145
I? A member of The Third?

00:18:42.354 --> 00:18:45.983
I've been wanting to ask you.

00:18:46.925 --> 00:18:48.916
Am I one of The Third?

00:18:49.027 --> 00:18:52.588
Or am I some other creature that
merely has an astral eye?

00:18:53.031 --> 00:18:54.931
Why do you ask such a thing?

00:18:55.367 --> 00:18:58.598
There is no room for doubt that
you are one of The Third.

00:19:03.108 --> 00:19:07.772
I think that's probably what I've
been contemplating all this time.

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:10.910
This whole entire time...

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:24.796
Huh. It looks kinda cramped in here.

00:19:24.796 --> 00:19:26.298
How're you doing?

00:19:26.298 --> 00:19:29.568
I was looking forward to seeing the view outside,

00:19:29.568 --> 00:19:31.770
but it's pitch black and I can't see a thing.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.101
You can see it on the way back.

00:19:33.238 --> 00:19:35.172
I wanted to see on the way, too.

00:19:35.541 --> 00:19:36.439
Honoka.

00:19:37.276 --> 00:19:39.073
Do like you always do.

00:19:40.779 --> 00:19:41.643
I will.

00:19:44.883 --> 00:19:47.044
Thanks, Bogie.

00:19:49.688 --> 00:19:50.313
Here it comes!

00:19:55.794 --> 00:19:56.692
Report!

00:19:56.962 --> 00:19:58.864
Enemy aerial units closing in.

00:19:58.864 --> 00:20:00.265
Fifteen targets.

00:20:00.265 --> 00:20:03.325
Believed to be autonomous soldiers
equipped with flight units.

00:20:03.602 --> 00:20:05.365
Contact in 90 seconds.

00:20:10.209 --> 00:20:14.339
STW-9000, Blue Breaker,
has scrambled to intercept.

00:20:14.446 --> 00:20:16.281
The enemy got the jump on us.

00:20:16.281 --> 00:20:17.475
Both of you, get in!

00:20:27.326 --> 00:20:31.626
Looks like that woman assigned us a crack pilot.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:35.197
STW-9000 has engaged the enemy units.

00:20:35.367 --> 00:20:37.836
Let's just hope that wolf keeps his sheepskin on.

00:20:37.836 --> 00:20:40.072
Bogie, start up the PSP.

00:20:40.072 --> 00:20:41.004
What are you planning?

00:20:41.373 --> 00:20:43.773
He can't hold them off all on his own.

00:20:43.909 --> 00:20:47.709
I won't say I can take on half,
but I'll draw some of them off.

00:20:47.846 --> 00:20:49.982
Juliet, how far are we from our destination?

00:20:49.982 --> 00:20:50.549
Who?

00:20:50.549 --> 00:20:52.244
Pilot, that's you.

00:20:52.751 --> 00:20:55.120
You had J-something written
on your fuselage, right?

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:57.247
So starting today, you're Juliet. Respond.

00:20:57.756 --> 00:21:01.126
In direct distance, we are
approximately 1.5 kilometers away.

00:21:01.126 --> 00:21:03.629
However, we are currently engaging
in evasive maneuvers,

00:21:03.629 --> 00:21:05.620
so it is possible for that distance to grow.

00:21:06.265 --> 00:21:09.301
It's a bit too far to muscle our way in.

00:21:09.301 --> 00:21:10.131
Let's get off here.

00:21:16.008 --> 00:21:16.702
The enemy's here.

00:21:17.342 --> 00:21:18.809
The enemy?

00:21:21.747 --> 00:21:23.408
Is it The Third?

00:21:43.969 --> 00:21:44.901
Here we go!

00:21:53.011 --> 00:21:56.448
An intersection waiting for morning...
Asa o matteiru kousaten ga

00:21:56.448 --> 00:22:00.452
...cradling an abandoned cat that wandered in.
Mayoikonda sute-neko o daiteiru

00:22:00.452 --> 00:22:03.055
Red and green and yellow.
Aka to ao to kiiro

00:22:03.055 --> 00:22:06.047
It is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:06.725 --> 00:22:10.162
Stopping just after dawn,
Akegata-sugi ni furiyanda

00:22:10.162 --> 00:22:14.199
a misty rain made a screen of water.
Kosame ga tsukutta mizu no sukuriin ga

00:22:14.199 --> 00:22:16.768
Until that time when it dries,
Kawaku sono toki made

00:22:16.768 --> 00:22:19.794
it is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:19.971 --> 00:22:23.442
More than small coincidences like that,
Sonna chiisana guuzen yori mo

00:22:23.442 --> 00:22:26.845
the fact that you are there...
Kimi ga soko ni iru koto ga

00:22:26.845 --> 00:22:30.349
...cannot be a small thing, I think.
Chiisai hazu ga nai to omounda

00:22:30.349 --> 00:22:33.978
Even though it's obvious.
Atarimae nandakedo

00:22:35.654 --> 00:22:42.427
It must be sad not to have anyone.
Daremo inai to kanashii koto deshou

00:22:42.427 --> 00:22:49.368
Now, come on out to where the sun is shining.
Saa hi no ataru basho e dete-oide

00:22:49.368 --> 00:22:56.208
Even the several incidents that trouble you...
Kimi o komaraseru ikutsuka no dekigoto mo

00:22:56.208 --> 00:23:01.168
...are coincidences of yesterdays past.
Kinou izen no guuzen nanda yo

00:23:03.048 --> 00:23:08.384
Though, I'm sure you actually know that already.
Hontou wa wakatteru to omou kedo

00:23:15.127 --> 00:23:16.856
Preview

00:23:17.129 --> 00:23:19.664
Breaking into Rona Fauna's base...

00:23:19.664 --> 00:23:25.694
It was like storming a secure fortress
guarded by The Third's forces.

00:23:26.004 --> 00:23:28.507
Unfamiliar with aerial combat,
I lost the transport plane...

00:23:28.507 --> 00:23:32.844
...and separated from both Bogie and Teacher,

00:23:32.844 --> 00:23:36.439
what awaited me were Blue Breaker
and a powerful weapon.

00:23:37.282 --> 00:23:40.719
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.719 --> 00:23:42.020
episode 19,
"Breaking Through Enemy Lines".

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:43.555
Breaking Through Enemy Lines
episode 19,
"Breaking Through Enemy Lines".

00:23:43.555 --> 00:23:44.886
Breaking Through Enemy Lines
